{"ts":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"c87bcedb1c3a62554cc6fd02","agent_provenance":{"model":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Context\nOfficial stable 4.x and current main heads remain unchanged and all 181 declared operations are mapped, but agents cannot inspect or execute an exact operation ID through one uniform contract-driven surface.\n\n## Delivery\n- Add `monica api inspect|get|mutate` over both bundled editions.\n- Validate operation identity, method class, path/query inputs, request bodies, content type, and mutation confirmation before dispatch.\n- Keep mutations behind both `--confirm` and the global read-only guard.\n- Integrate deterministic outputs, help, docs, agent contracts, read-only acceptance, current PM/changelog tooling, and release gates.\n\n## Safety\nLive validation uses only GET operations with `readOnlyMode=true`. Credentials, identifiers, response bodies, and private topology stay in `~/.monica-cli` and never enter Git, PM, logs, or GitHub."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"monica-openapi-operation-execution"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Execute exact Monica OpenAPI operations safely"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Add contract-driven inspect, read, and explicitly confirmed mutation commands that resolve exact operations from bundled stable and next Monica OpenAPI editions, validate declared inputs, and preserve read-only privacy guarantees."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":0},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","api-contracts","api-execution","documentation","openapi","read-only-safety","typescript"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-08-07T20:21:41.941Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/assignee","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":720},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Exact stable and next operation IDs are inspectable offline; api get accepts only GET operations and validates path/query input; api mutate rejects GET operations, requires --confirm, validates input/body/content type, and is blocked by readOnlyMode before dispatch; outputs are deterministic and schema-valid; complete help and docs; latest compatible pm-cli and pm-changelog; exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, docstrings, under-300 LOC, duplication, type, security, PM, changelog, package, and actual read-only CLI gates pass; no private data is exposed"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/definition_of_ready","value":"All 63 PM items and metadata reviewed, histories and graph audited, duplicate scan clear, stable and main sources current, OpenAPI and agent-tool lineage inspected, clean master baseline confirmed"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"monica-platform"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"exact-contract-operation-execution"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Give agents a zero-guesswork standards-driven execution surface for every Monica API operation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Reduces integration friction while keeping writes mechanically gated and auditable."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"Any bundled Monica operation can be inspected and safely dispatched by exact identity."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"Portable contracts are complete; executable contract consumption is the next leverage point."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"monica-platform"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reviewer","value":"github-bots"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":95},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/sprint","value":"2026-07-api-execution"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/release","value":"next"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reporter","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"Monica stable 4.x v4.1.2 and current main; Bun 1.3.11; Node 22+; private instance read-only"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Run monica --help: no top-level exact-operation executor exists despite complete bundled contracts."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"Agents inspect and execute exact declared operations without hand-translating OpenAPI or bypassing safety."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Only resource leaves and offline OpenAPI export exist; exact operation IDs are not executable."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/affected_version","value":"2026.7.27"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"api-execution"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/regression","value":false},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/customer_impact","value":"Consumers must map contract operations back to bespoke leaves themselves."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"monica-agent-tool-contracts","kind":"verifies","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"monica-api-4x-parity","kind":"verifies","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"monica-api-4x-parity-plan","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"monica-api-source-freshness","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"monica-config-output-secret-sink","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"monica-next-api-editions","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"monica-official-toon-contracts","kind":"verifies","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"monica-openapi-edition-contracts","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"monica-server-diagnostics","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Duplicate research covered all 63 items, full all-status metadata, exact-operation queries, and 1,025 similarity pairs at 0.72 with zero clusters; closed OpenAPI, parity, and agent-contract items are predecessors."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Official research refreshed 2026-07-31: stable 4.x remains 32028ce at v4.1.2 with 172 routes; main remains e08e917 with 9 routes; both source checks are current."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Endpoint mapping and portable contracts do not provide uniform execution; operation identity, input validation, and mutation classification must be one contract."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/files","value":[{"path":"src/commands/api.ts","scope":"project","note":"exact operation command surface"}]},{"op":"add","pa